id",", ",[210,302,303],{},"refund.completed",", or ",[210,306,307],{},"subscription_plan.update_approved",". See the ",[215,310,217],{"href":311},"\u002Fguides\u002Fwebhooks#event-types"," for the full list.",[231,314,315,320,324],{},[249,316,317],{},[210,318,319],{},"entityType",[249,321,322],{},[210,323,258],{},[249,325,326,327,300,330,300,333,300,336,300,339,304,342,218],{},"The resource type the event refers to, such as ",[210,328,329],{},"order",[210,331,332],{},"refund",[210,334,335],{},"subscription",[210,337,338],{},"checkout",[210,340,341],{},"one_off_product",[210,343,344],{},"subscription_plan",[231,346,347,352,356],{},[249,348,349],{},[210,350,351],{},"entityId",[249,353,354],{},[210,355,258],{},[249,357,358],{},"The ID of the related resource.",[231,360,361,366,370],{},[249,362,363],{},[210,364,365],{},"object",[249,367,368],{},[210,369,365],{},[249,371,372,373,375,376,379,380,382,383,386,387,218],{},"The full resource payload as it existed when the event occurred (an Order, Chargeback, Refund, Subscription, Checkout, OneOffProduct, or SubscriptionPlan), keyed by its own ",[210,374,272],{}," field. Note ",[210,377,378],{},"object.resource"," can differ from ",[210,381,319],{},": chargeback events carry ",[210,384,385],{},"entityType: order"," but a Chargeback ",[210,388,365],{},[231,390,391,396,400],{},[249,392,393],{},[210,394,395],{},"createdAt",[249,397,398],{},[210,399,258],{},[249,401,402],{},"When the event occurred (ISO 8601 format).",[231,404,405,410,415],{},[249,406,407],{},[210,408,409],{},"testmode",[249,411,412],{},[210,413,414],{},"boolean",[249,416,417],{},"Whether the event originated from a test-mode resource.",[231,419,420,425,429],{},[249,421,422],{},[210,423,424],{},"links",[249,426,427],{},[210,428,365],{},[249,430,431,432,218],{},"HATEOAS links. Contains ",[210,433,434],{},"self",[436,437],"hr",{},[196,439,441],{"id":440},"get-a-webhook-event","Get a webhook event",[201,443,444],{},[210,445,446],{},"GET \u002Fv1\u002Fwebhook-events\